{
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "n01",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 30,
      "text": "项目依赖统一用 uv 管理，不引入 pip 或 poetry；虚拟环境在 .venv。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n02",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 20,
      "text": "跑测试必须用 .venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/ -o addopts=\"\" -q，直接 pytest 会带上覆盖率参数变慢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n03",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 25,
      "text": "模型后端用 dashscope 的 compatible-mode（qwen），配置写在 config.local.yaml，key 不进 git。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n04",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 40,
      "text": "AI_CODING_PTY=1 和 AI_CODING_MCP_STDIO=1 是两条门控环境变量，用来开真 pty 与真 MCP stdio 用例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n05",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 18,
      "text": "提交信息里不要出现反引号，多行信息用 git commit -F 读文件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n06",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 5,
      "age_days": 60,
      "text": "提示词缓存的关键是前缀稳定：系统提示与历史保持字节一致，易失内容只能追加在请求尾部。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n07",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 22,
      "text": "记忆只有两个注入面：常驻的 memory-constraints 块（pinned 与 decision），和按需调用的 memory_search 工具。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n08",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 15,
      "text": "轨迹每回合写一个 turn-N.jsonl，一行一个 span，字段是 v/ts/session/turn/span/parent/iter/evt/data。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n09",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 5,
      "age_days": 12,
      "text": "回答用户时不要和稀泥，必须给出明确决策和理由。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 35,
      "text": "bash 工具只在 Linux 上验证过，取消时要 killpg 加 reap 才杀得干净。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 5,
      "age_days": 50,
      "text": "不要引入 agent 框架，循环由项目自己维护，只依赖 openai 与 mcp 两个库。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 28,
      "text": "子智能体默认继承父上下文（subagent_context_mode=full），task_only 时给它一个干净窗口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 33,
      "text": "上下文压缩有四层：L3 大结果落盘、L1 裁剪中段、L2 老工具结果换信封、L4 用模型摘要。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 26,
      "text": "记忆存储是单文件 JSON（.memory），不是 SQLite。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 10,
      "text": "还没决定要不要把记忆迁移到 SQLite 加 FTS5。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 16,
      "text": "文档要跟着代码改，features/data-contracts/architecture 等六份每轮同步。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 45,
      "text": "CI 用的 Python 是 3.13，但 mypy 按 3.10 下限检查。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 21,
      "text": "MCP 远端工具的审批用 servers[].auto_approve 豁免，默认仍然要问用户。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 24,
      "text": "工作目录里的 .ai-coding/traces 是轨迹目录，sessions/ 是会话目录。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n20",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 5,
      "age_days": 5,
      "text": "改代码要 TDD：先写红测试再实现，不准改既有断言。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 14,
      "text": "依赖门禁由 ai.enforce_dependencies 开关控制，默认开；关掉就回到 R1 的宽松行为。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n22",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 19,
      "text": "memory_search 返回的 note 会作为 tool 结果追加进历史，从那一刻起就被缓存。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n23",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 17,
      "text": "决定不装 OpenTelemetry SDK，只导出 OTLP/JSON 文件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n24",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 29,
      "text": "工具面的 token 预算告警阈值是 tools_chars，超过会每个 loop 提示一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n25",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 55,
      "text": "用户偏好中文交流，技术术语可以保留英文原词。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 31,
      "text": "允许联网搜索，允许使用 skill。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 42,
      "text": "项目路径是 /home/linsir365/projects/ai-coding。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 23,
      "text": "会话文件 sessions/*.json 落盘是 camelCase，Python 侧是 snake_case，靠 loader 归一化。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 13,
      "text": "checkpoint_write 写的一句话只进本会话的摘要环，跨会话记东西要用 memory_write。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n30",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 11,
      "text": "收割游标 harvested_messages 存在 session 里，收割失败时不能推进。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 9,
      "text": "召回打分等于 0.55 乘相关性加 0.20 乘新近度加 0.15 乘重要度，再加 kind 加成，阈值 0.25。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n32",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 34,
      "text": "相关性用的是 idf 加权覆盖度，不是 BM25。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 36,
      "text": "不搞向量检索和 embedding（即 RAG），relevance.py 留了 RecallScorer 接缝。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n34",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 27,
      "text": "中文分词用字符 bigram，英文用词加一份停用词表。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n35",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 44,
      "text": "不喜欢过度设计，坚持 YAGNI。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n36",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 8,
      "text": "每次都要在真实环境跑一遍，不能只跑单元测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n37",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 20,
      "text": "验收脚本放在 scripts 目录下，形如 rN_cases.py，分离线与 --real 两种。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n38",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 28,
      "text": "记忆的淘汰上限是 max_index_entries，默认 200 条。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n39",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 32,
      "text": "钩子是 fail-open，门卫是 fail-closed，两者语义不能混。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n40",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 26,
      "text": "审批超时默认 0 秒，表示只受回合时钟约束。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n41",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 25,
      "text": "子智能体不能再起子智能体，它的工具栈里没有 subAgent。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n42",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 22,
      "text": "工具并发上限 max_concurrent_tools 默认是 4。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n43",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 15,
      "text": "先说结论再给理由。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n44",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 30,
      "text": "不把 sessions/*.json 直接交给模型读，实测会整读 270KB。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n45",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 7,
      "text": "导出 HTML 要把所有动态字符串做 escape，否则工具输出里的 script 标签会执行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n46",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 1,
      "age_days": 37,
      "text": "SQLite 的 FTS5 是一个全文检索扩展。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n47",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 1,
      "age_days": 38,
      "text": "BM25 是一种基于词频和文档长度的排序函数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n48",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 1,
      "age_days": 39,
      "text": "embedding 可以把文本映射成向量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n49",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 6,
      "text": "喜欢简洁的回答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n50",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 1,
      "age_days": 41,
      "text": "uv 是一个 Python 包管理器。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n51",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 6,
      "text": "todo_write 的 depends_on 现在是硬门禁：转到 in_progress 或 completed 会被 blocked_by_dependencies 拦住。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n52",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 5,
      "age_days": 0,
      "text": "今天要把 docs 目录里的 CLI 章节重写一遍。"
    },
