      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 12,
      "text": "还没定要不要给验收脚本加超时保护，长跑的用例目前靠人工掐表。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n54",
      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 20,
      "text": "未定：子智能体要不要默认开 git worktree 隔离。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n55",
      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 26,
      "text": "还在权衡压缩策略要不要改成先摘要再裁剪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n56",
      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 31,
      "text": "还没决定 UI 层是否继续押注 Textual。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n57",
      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 15,
      "text": "待定：轨迹默认是否导出 OTLP。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n58",
      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 34,
      "text": "未定：是否支持 Windows，bash 工具只在 Linux 上验过。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n59",
      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 9,
      "text": "没定：多智能体之间要不要共享记忆，还是各自隔离。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n60",
      "kind": "open_thread",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 22,
      "text": "没定：记忆的注入预算要不要按 token 算而不是按字符。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n61",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 11,
      "text": "每回合结束会写一条 usage 记录，含 prompt、completion、cached 三个 token 数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n62",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 17,
      "text": "回合计时用 turn_started_at 与 turn_finished_at 两个字段，界面靠它显示本回合耗时。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n63",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 13,
      "text": "门卫在工具执行前检查输入，钩子在回合边界触发，两者时机不同。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n64",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 29,
      "text": "OTLP 导出的是 JSON 文件，一行一个 span，字段是 trace_id、span_id、name、start、end。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n65",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 16,
      "text": "会话 JSON 的 schema_version 字段用来做向后兼容迁移。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n66",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 24,
      "text": "工具执行失败会返回结构化的 error 字段，模型据此决定重试还是换路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n67",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 19,
      "text": "回合超时由 turn_timeout_seconds 控制，默认 600 秒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n68",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 27,
      "text": "worktree 隔离只在子智能体上生效，主循环始终待在项目根目录。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n69",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 21,
      "text": "预算超限时门卫会拒绝新回合，界面显示剩余额度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n70",
      "kind": "fact",
      "importance": 2,
      "age_days": 23,
      "text": "轨迹目录默认按轮次分层，r7 的数据落在 .ai-coding/traces/r7。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n71",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 38,
      "text": "决定不用 LangChain 一类现成编排库，理由是循环语义要完全可控。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n72",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 32,
      "text": "决定错误一律走结构化字段，不塞进自然语言 output。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n73",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 25,
      "text": "决定测试里的时间一律注入，不读系统时钟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n74",
      "kind": "decision",
      "importance": 5,
      "age_days": 14,
      "text": "决定不把密钥写进任何提交过的文件，包括 config.example.yaml。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n75",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 18,
      "text": "代码注释用中文，docstring 讲清「为什么」而不是「是什么」。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n76",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 10,
      "text": "不接受先合了再补测试。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n77",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 3,
      "age_days": 8,
      "text": "倾向小步提交，一个 commit 只做一件事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "n78",
      "kind": "preference",
      "importance": 4,
      "age_days": 6,
      "text": "文档里的数字必须来自实测，不接受估算。"
    }
